1
00:00:01,969 --> 00:00:05,909
(Sheldon:)I recently read
that during World War Two,

2
00:00:05,906 --> 00:00:08,276
(Sheldon:)Joseph Stalin had
a research program

3
00:00:08,275 --> 00:00:09,875
(Sheldon:)to create
supersoldiers

4
00:00:09,877 --> 00:00:13,247
(Sheldon:)by having women
impregnated by gorillas.

5
00:00:14,314 --> 00:00:16,814
(Howard:)What a sick use
of science.

6
00:00:16,817 --> 00:00:18,947
(Raj:)Hey, as long as
the baby's healthy.

7
00:00:20,621 --> 00:00:22,821
(Amy:)I wonder if Stalin considered
any other animals.

8
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:24,823
(Leonard:)Hippos are
the deadliest creature.

9
00:00:24,825 --> 00:00:27,795
(Leonard:)A half-human, half-hippo soldier
would be pretty badass.

10
00:00:29,162 --> 00:00:31,162
(Howard:)Yes, but when they're
hungry-hungry,

11
00:00:31,164 --> 00:00:32,864
(Howard:)you can stop them
with marbles.

12
00:00:34,334 --> 00:00:35,504
(Sheldon:)Yeah, the correct animal

13
00:00:35,502 --> 00:00:38,072
(Sheldon:)for interspecies supersolider
is koala.

14
00:00:38,071 --> 00:00:42,441
(Sheldon:)You would wind up with an army
so cute it couldn't be attacked.

15
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:46,514
(Raj:)But half-man, half-owl
could fly...

16
00:00:46,513 --> 00:00:49,953
(Sheldon:)The answer is cuddly soldiers
with big flat noses. Moving on.

17
00:00:51,251 --> 00:00:52,751
(Howard:)So, Penny, when's
the new job start?

18
00:00:52,753 --> 00:00:53,953
(Penny:)Next Monday.

19
00:00:53,954 --> 00:00:55,384
(Bernadette:)Did you get a chance
to look over

20
00:00:55,389 --> 00:00:56,389
(Bernadette:)the materials I gave you?

21
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,520
(Penny:)Uh, not yet,
but I will.

22
00:00:57,524 --> 00:00:59,694
(Bernadette:)Great. When?

23
00:00:59,693 --> 00:01:05,023
(Penny:)I said I'll get to it.

